                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "a very weird mash of genres that works really well how i have no idea\n\npros:\n,its really fun,\n,some music jams are great,\n,has pretty good graphics,\n,the commentator is quiet entertaining,\n,good looking maps,\n\ncons: \n,AI has perfect aim,\n,runs like $hit with 3v3,\n,only 6 maps,(at the time of writing)\n,the render distance for items and for inflicting damage is to short,\n,seems to be built like a microtransactions infested game yet doesnt have em insted they have a premium DLC for 20$ witch for what the game is and the fact that half of it is free seems to high (witch make me belive they might be added later on insted of or with premium),\n,you cant invite friends via steam so online is limated to randoms, \n,getting premium cards from crates when you dont have premium is very infuriating,\n,getting scrap to get cards is a grind,\n,could use a zoom out feature,\n\n\n(ps you should change the screenshots they make it look like a raceing game)",
